  "version": "0.12.0-alpha.2",
  "notes": "## 0.12.0-alpha.2 - 2026-05-25\n\n### Features\n\n- Show available updates in a dedicated in-app window with release notes and install actions instead of relying on a system notification (#854)\n- Add a download step to mobile device pairing so first-time phone users can scan the app download page before pairing (#855)\n- Show a native macOS receive progress HUD for incoming files with per-transfer cancel controls (#848)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Prevent clipboard history from appearing empty after an interrupted space switch is resumed (#857)\n- Make LAN syncing faster and prevent offline devices from delaying clipboard copies (#852)\n- Ignore empty placeholder files from other clipboard tools so they no longer trigger repeated remote sync notifications (#849)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.12.0-alpha.2 - 2026-05-25\n\n### Features\n\n- 发现新版本时改为打开带有发布说明和安装操作的应用内更新窗口，不再依赖系统通知提示 (#854)\n- 移动设备配对新增下载步骤，首次使用手机端的用户可以先扫码打开应用下载页再继续配对 (#855)\n- macOS 上接收文件时新增原生进度浮窗，并可直接取消单个传输 (#848)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复空间切换中断后恢复时剪贴板历史可能显示为空的问题 (#857)\n- 提升局域网同步速度，并避免已离线设备拖慢剪贴板复制 (#852)\n- 忽略其他剪贴板工具写入的空占位文件，避免反复触发远端同步通知 (#849)",
